WEBVTT

00:18.280 --> 00:19.960
Your Highness, it's
time for your medicine.

00:21.190 --> 00:21.870
Your Highness?

00:30.070 --> 00:32.030
Your Highness, it's time
for your medicine.

00:33.350 --> 00:34.350
Your Highness, wake up.

00:44.710 --> 00:45.430
Your Highness!

00:45.640 --> 00:46.350
Your Highness!

00:46.520 --> 00:47.110
Somebody!

00:47.390 --> 00:48.390
Somebody!

00:48.710 --> 00:50.560
Somebody! Get help!

00:50.790 --> 00:51.920
Somebody!

02:14.460 --> 02:15.216
=Blossoms of Power=

02:15.216 --> 02:18.060
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:18.140 --> 02:21.100
=Episode 11=

02:22.240 --> 02:23.470
Your Majesty,

02:23.590 --> 02:26.120
Consort Liang died of
blood stasis syndrome.

02:26.360 --> 02:27.560
The illness progresses rapidly.

02:27.960 --> 02:30.240
It can turn fatal within hours.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.310
Your Majesty,

02:39.470 --> 02:41.630
blood stasis syndrome can spread miasma.

02:41.870 --> 02:44.190
We shouldn't stay here any longer.

02:47.120 --> 02:48.430
Choose an auspicious day.

02:49.248 --> 02:51.552
Lay her to rest in the imperial
mausoleum with full honors.

02:51.584 --> 02:52.512
Yes, Your Majesty.

03:03.680 --> 03:04.560
Father.

03:06.030 --> 03:07.560
I ask for your permission

03:07.910 --> 03:09.960
to let me keep vigil
at my mother's tomb.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.750
Your mother came from a distant land.

03:12.840 --> 03:15.080
You're the only child she left behind.

03:15.750 --> 03:17.280
If she's watching from the afterlife,

03:17.630 --> 03:20.150
she would not want to see
you waste away like this.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.520
Stay here

03:22.800 --> 03:24.910
with your grandmother and me instead.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.030
Thank you for your concern, Father,

03:28.680 --> 03:30.430
but I have no other wish in life

03:31.120 --> 03:33.190
than to fulfill my filial
duty at Mother's tomb.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.710
Please grant me this wish, Father.

03:40.910 --> 03:42.280
I never would've expected this.

03:42.280 --> 03:44.280
Mo Yuan was investigating
Consort Liang's crimes,

03:44.470 --> 03:45.800
and now she's suddenly dead.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.000
I originally thought

03:48.000 --> 03:50.030
she was taking revenge
on me for her brother, Ye Qi.

03:50.512 --> 03:51.960
But now that she's died so suddenly,

03:53.000 --> 03:54.310
someone must've silenced her.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.630
Your Highness, are you saying

03:56.960 --> 03:58.030
this wasn't a coincidence?

03:59.630 --> 04:00.310
Your Highness,

04:00.520 --> 04:01.560
I'm back.

04:01.840 --> 04:03.360
There's no one even in charge

04:03.470 --> 04:05.190
of Consort Liang's Yilan Palace now.

04:05.190 --> 04:06.120
It's complete chaos.

04:06.520 --> 04:08.680
The Sixth Prince is rather strange, too.

04:08.750 --> 04:10.030
You could say he's a devoted son,

04:10.030 --> 04:11.590
but he didn't shed a single tear.

04:11.590 --> 04:13.080
Yet you can't call him unfilial either,

04:13.120 --> 04:14.864
since he volunteered to guard her tomb.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.160
Was there anything unusual

04:17.200 --> 04:18.608
before Consort Liang's sudden death?

04:18.870 --> 04:19.430
Yes.

04:19.800 --> 04:21.120
She was scratched by a cat.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.950
She applied a certain hand balm.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.750
I secretly brought some back.

04:32.240 --> 04:34.240
This balm contains cold fern.

04:34.750 --> 04:36.000
It smells sweet to humans,

04:36.270 --> 04:38.120
but it drives cats and
dogs into a frenzy.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.800
Consort Liang was scratched

04:39.800 --> 04:41.232
because she was wearing this balm.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.510
Someone must've

04:43.510 --> 04:44.912
coated the cat's claws with poison.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.270
Your Highness, who do you suspect?

04:46.270 --> 04:47.310
Noble Consort Rong.

04:47.720 --> 04:50.070
She once ordered Lady Hu to harm you.

04:50.950 --> 04:53.120
Noble Consort Rong and
Consort Liang both have sons.

04:53.296 --> 04:55.008
Naturally, they saw
each other as rivals.

04:55.720 --> 04:57.000
Everyone in this palace

04:57.480 --> 04:59.240
hides behind layer
upon layer of deception.

04:59.830 --> 05:01.000
One careless mistake,

05:01.000 --> 05:02.310
and you're finished.

05:03.870 --> 05:05.480
It's impossible to
guard against everyone.

05:06.190 --> 05:08.120
Fortunately, you and the Crown Prince

05:08.120 --> 05:09.560
have decided to stand together

05:09.560 --> 05:10.480
through whatever comes.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.630
I really should thank him for that.

05:16.950 --> 05:17.680
Tian Yuan,

05:18.360 --> 05:19.360
don't you think

05:19.696 --> 05:21.872
there's something suspicious
about Consort Liang's death?

05:22.390 --> 05:23.000
Your Highness,

05:23.360 --> 05:25.600
the imperial physician said
it was blood stasis syndrome,

05:26.040 --> 05:26.950
but I think

05:27.430 --> 05:28.800
she was more likely poisoned.

05:28.912 --> 05:31.952
There aren't many poisons that
could fool the Imperial Medical Office.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.750
It reminds me of the person
who poisoned me.

05:36.190 --> 05:38.070
You mean the person
who killed Consort Liang

05:38.190 --> 05:39.360
and the one who poisoned you

05:39.600 --> 05:40.680
could be the same person?

05:41.680 --> 05:42.870
Their methods are similar,

05:43.430 --> 05:45.488
and both culprits are hidden
deep within the palace.

05:45.600 --> 05:46.830
That's exactly what I suspect.

05:47.072 --> 05:48.560
There's something else strange, too.

05:48.688 --> 05:50.480
That foreign merchant
who sold the poison

05:50.600 --> 05:52.160
seems to have vanished into thin air.

05:52.192 --> 05:53.760
There's no trace of him anywhere.

05:54.416 --> 05:56.190
Send all the clues
related to Consort Liang

05:56.190 --> 05:57.920
to Zhao Zhenghao,

05:57.920 --> 05:59.430
Cui Jinbai, and Hua Fuhai as well.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.024
Yes, Your Highness.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.430
Speak.

06:11.430 --> 06:12.680
I heard

06:13.680 --> 06:16.750
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's brother,
Shen Yun'an,

06:16.768 --> 06:18.500
has asked permission
to come to the capital.

06:18.750 --> 06:19.920
He and the Duke of Wei

06:20.016 --> 06:22.672
don't seem to approve of
your marriage to Her Highness.

06:24.240 --> 06:25.390
Good. Let him come.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.560
Then he can see for himself

06:28.160 --> 06:30.680
exactly what kind of man I am.

06:32.928 --> 06:33.950
He's bound to like me.

06:42.112 --> 06:44.120
Young Master will be arriving
in the capital soon.

06:44.120 --> 06:45.510
Everyone, be on your best behavior.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.560
- Yes.
- Yes.

06:52.000 --> 06:52.720
Your Highness.

06:55.120 --> 06:56.560
I haven't seen my brother in so long.

06:57.240 --> 06:59.430
I wonder what his
temper's like these days.

06:59.630 --> 07:00.480
Your Highness,

07:00.480 --> 07:01.630
you said it yourself.

07:01.630 --> 07:03.600
Young Master's always
been straightforward,

07:03.720 --> 07:05.070
a true man of the northwest.

07:05.216 --> 07:06.950
You've only been in
the capital for a while.

07:06.950 --> 07:09.040
His temper couldn't
have changed that quickly.

07:09.240 --> 07:09.830
That's true.

07:11.190 --> 07:11.870
Zhen Zhu,

07:12.560 --> 07:14.190
you know my brother's habits well.

07:14.630 --> 07:15.630
Keep a close eye on them.

07:16.144 --> 07:17.488
Don't worry, Your Highness.

07:20.160 --> 07:21.560
Young Master has an old leg injury.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.896
It flares up whenever he gets cold.

07:23.040 --> 07:24.270
This quilt's too thin.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.120
Bring a thicker one.

07:25.240 --> 07:25.920
- Yes.
- Yes.

07:25.984 --> 07:27.720
Young Master likes
to take big gulps of tea.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.070
This cup's too small.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.510
Bring out the jade tea set

07:30.510 --> 07:32.512
with the evergreen pine
design from the storeroom.

07:32.520 --> 07:34.160
Young Master enjoys
reading military texts.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.330
Place those books on warfare

07:35.344 --> 07:36.928
somewhere within easy reach in his room.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.630
Three,

07:40.070 --> 07:40.560
two,

07:41.070 --> 07:41.560
one,

07:41.750 --> 07:42.240
run!

07:48.720 --> 07:49.430
Yun'an,

07:49.630 --> 07:51.360
I won!

08:04.240 --> 08:04.950
Your Highness.

08:06.190 --> 08:06.870
Your Highness.

08:07.920 --> 08:08.720
What's wrong?

08:11.240 --> 08:12.680
I miss my brother a little.

08:12.800 --> 08:13.920
Don't worry, Your Highness.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.240
I'll take care of everything here.

08:16.680 --> 08:17.680
Your Highness,

08:17.750 --> 08:20.160
why don't you think about
how to thank the Crown Prince?

08:21.616 --> 08:24.224
His Highness seems to be quite
fond of experimenting with pastries.

08:24.310 --> 08:26.190
Every time you visit the East Palace,

08:26.190 --> 08:28.120
he has snacks prepared in advance,

08:28.120 --> 08:29.310
and they're never the same.

08:29.430 --> 08:31.240
He must be quite the foodie.

08:32.840 --> 08:35.000
He should eat something
that's easy to digest.

08:35.600 --> 08:37.390
I'll make him a bowl
of delicate wontons.

08:37.550 --> 08:39.840
You're thinking about Crown Prince
more and more these days.

08:42.624 --> 08:44.752
Your Highness, you helped
me solve Consort Liang's case.

08:44.816 --> 08:46.496
I didn't know how else to repay you.

08:48.270 --> 08:49.840
You made these wontons yourself?

08:50.270 --> 08:51.320
You're still in poor health.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.510
Eating too much could
upset your stomach,

08:53.552 --> 08:54.950
so I only served you a small portion.

08:54.960 --> 08:55.870
I never expected

08:55.880 --> 08:57.550
I'd be lucky enough
to taste your cooking.

08:57.600 --> 09:01.620
(Auspicious Blessings)

09:26.200 --> 09:27.360
They're tender and silky,

09:27.760 --> 09:29.120
with a wonderful lingering flavor.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.960
Whenever anyone else makes them,

09:32.120 --> 09:33.270
I always find them too greasy.

09:33.960 --> 09:34.910
But yours

09:35.550 --> 09:36.600
are just right.

09:38.240 --> 09:40.360
Three wasn't nearly enough.

09:40.910 --> 09:42.840
I'll have the kitchen
prepare the same filling.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.120
Would you

09:44.390 --> 09:45.480
make them for me again?

09:47.080 --> 09:47.630
All right.

10:04.320 --> 10:05.510
There's a legend in northwest.

10:06.320 --> 10:08.030
Hundun was once a vicious ancient beast,

10:08.270 --> 10:10.720
bloodthirsty and cruel,
bringing suffering to the world

10:10.910 --> 10:12.320
and leaving the people no peace.

10:12.630 --> 10:14.320
It's said that eating wontons
named after it

10:14.390 --> 10:15.960
can ward off evil and misfortune,

10:16.240 --> 10:17.360
and bring peace,

10:17.360 --> 10:18.320
good fortune, and safety.

10:21.584 --> 10:23.216
Thank you for such
a thoughtful gesture.

10:30.790 --> 10:32.000
Speaking of northwest,

10:33.030 --> 10:34.480
Your Highness, what do you think

10:34.480 --> 10:35.360
of the Northwest Army?

10:35.720 --> 10:36.790
Why do you ask?

10:39.030 --> 10:40.270
Some say

10:40.510 --> 10:43.670
the Northwest Army is the pillar
that keeps the realm secure.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.150
Others say

10:45.240 --> 10:46.630
the Duke of Wei holds enough power

10:46.790 --> 10:48.200
to carve out a kingdom of his own,

10:48.480 --> 10:50.750
so civil and military authority
should be divided.

10:51.480 --> 10:52.630
What do you think?

10:55.240 --> 10:56.440
To govern the northwest,

10:57.550 --> 10:59.870
you need a strong army
to repel foreign enemies,

11:00.030 --> 11:02.080
and sound governance
to keep the rear secure.

11:02.670 --> 11:04.200
Every one of those tasks

11:04.304 --> 11:06.240
requires civil and military
power to work as one.

11:06.390 --> 11:07.600
If they're divided,

11:08.064 --> 11:09.510
they'll only hold each other back,

11:09.600 --> 11:11.184
and the northwest will never be stable.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.080
You're a Crown Prince of great insight

11:14.270 --> 11:15.720
and ambition.

11:16.120 --> 11:17.150
When you take the throne,

11:17.600 --> 11:19.720
Daxing will surely enjoy
lasting peace and prosperity.

11:23.630 --> 11:24.750
I'll remember

11:25.320 --> 11:26.910
everything that matters to you.

11:28.600 --> 11:29.440
Your family

11:29.960 --> 11:30.960
will remain safe,

11:31.480 --> 11:32.270
and the northwest

11:32.720 --> 11:33.550
will know peace.

11:33.960 --> 11:35.000
Can you promise me that?

11:35.270 --> 11:35.720
I can.

11:40.768 --> 11:42.030
But I don't trust anyone else,

11:42.750 --> 11:44.320
nor will I place my family's lives

11:44.510 --> 11:45.600
in someone else's hands.

11:48.720 --> 11:49.600
What a coincidence.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.720
Neither will I.

11:53.750 --> 11:55.600
Then let's choose to trust ourselves.

11:56.150 --> 11:58.600
If we succeed, it'll be
because we were more capable,

11:58.672 --> 11:59.940
and we'll have nothing to regret.

11:59.960 --> 12:02.550
If we fail, it'll be
because we were outmatched,

12:02.672 --> 12:04.112
and we'll accept the consequences.

12:17.500 --> 12:22.060
(Sixian Hall)

12:22.150 --> 12:23.080
It's windy outside.

12:23.168 --> 12:24.816
You needn't see me out, Your Highness.

12:25.264 --> 12:26.576
Take care, Your Highness.

12:53.870 --> 12:54.670
Xihe.

13:00.390 --> 13:01.720
I can see colors now.

13:03.270 --> 13:04.270
That's wonderful.

13:04.270 --> 13:05.520
Congratulations, Your Highness.

13:06.390 --> 13:07.550
Now that my eyes have healed,

13:08.480 --> 13:09.080
are you

13:09.670 --> 13:11.030
even a little happy for me?

13:29.580 --> 13:34.540
(Sixian Hall)

13:44.460 --> 13:48.620
(Shen Yun'an, Heir to the Duke of Wei)

13:48.630 --> 13:49.790
Who is that young master?

13:49.790 --> 13:51.120
He carries himself with such poise.

13:51.390 --> 13:52.320
Young Master Shen.

14:03.300 --> 14:04.740
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

14:18.440 --> 14:19.200
He's here.

14:26.400 --> 14:28.832
- Greetings, Young Master.
- Greetings, Young Master.

14:30.200 --> 14:30.750
Yun'an.

14:40.510 --> 14:41.870
Let me get a good look at you.

14:42.336 --> 14:43.808
My little sister's even prettier now.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.000
And you've

14:47.120 --> 14:48.080
gotten a little tanned.

14:49.030 --> 14:49.910
You little tease.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.200
Uncle Qing,

14:51.328 --> 14:52.320
it's been a long time.

14:52.720 --> 14:54.550
Greetings, Young Master.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.390
Yun'an,

14:55.720 --> 14:57.240
your room is ready.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.440
Let's go inside and talk.

14:59.320 --> 14:59.750
All right.

15:05.540 --> 15:08.140
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

15:16.816 --> 15:18.840
You've been in the capital
for quite some time now.

15:19.000 --> 15:21.000
Father's been worried
sick about your marriage.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.120
When the Anxi defense map went missing,

15:23.670 --> 15:25.720
I heard Prince Lie used
it to ask for your hand.

15:25.760 --> 15:27.808
That left Father with a
poor impression of him.

15:27.870 --> 15:28.512
But I think

15:28.528 --> 15:31.460
the fact that he risked execution for
deceiving the emperor to help our family

15:31.480 --> 15:33.080
proves how deeply he cares for you.

15:33.200 --> 15:33.960
Yun'an,

15:35.000 --> 15:37.200
Prince Lie isn't the
man I want to marry.

15:38.200 --> 15:40.200
Such a spirited young man,

15:40.200 --> 15:41.910
willing to risk everything
to protect you...

15:42.256 --> 15:43.984
You truly don't have feelings for him?

15:47.910 --> 15:49.510
Then, among all the princes,

15:49.510 --> 15:51.080
who exactly have you chosen?

15:53.480 --> 15:54.150
The Crown Prince.

15:55.936 --> 15:58.208
Everyone knows he's been frail and
sickly since childhood,

15:58.256 --> 15:59.550
as fragile as a willow branch.

15:59.550 --> 16:00.848
He's hardly an ideal husband.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.270
Why him?

16:03.750 --> 16:05.390
His character and temperament

16:05.550 --> 16:06.720
are exactly what I admire.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.320
And precisely because he's frail,

16:09.320 --> 16:10.510
he won't try to dominate me.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.390
Compared to a capable, forceful man,

16:12.670 --> 16:15.480
I'd rather have a husband who's
obedient and easy to handle.

16:15.550 --> 16:17.200
That way, life will be
much more peaceful.

16:18.000 --> 16:19.480
So you've chosen him

16:19.750 --> 16:21.480
because he's frail and easy to control?

16:26.870 --> 16:28.030
Did someone hurt you?

16:29.600 --> 16:30.960
If someone had,

16:31.150 --> 16:33.344
do you think I'd still be
sitting here safe and sound?

16:34.720 --> 16:36.150
That wicked servant Ling Long

16:36.150 --> 16:37.824
pushed you into the river
on Xiao's orders.

16:37.856 --> 16:39.750
Father and I were beside
ourselves with worry.

16:39.750 --> 16:41.840
We only felt relieved
when we heard you were unharmed.

16:43.320 --> 16:45.360
You faced such danger
the moment you arrived.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.550
After coming to the capital,

16:47.550 --> 16:49.630
did all the scheming
here frighten you so much

16:49.630 --> 16:51.510
that now you only want
security, not true love?

16:51.910 --> 16:52.750
If that's the case,

16:52.816 --> 16:54.030
you should return to northwest.

16:54.048 --> 16:55.880
I'll stay in the capital
and marry a princess.

16:55.904 --> 16:56.560
No.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.440
I know you want to protect me.

17:00.080 --> 17:01.510
But if you marry a princess,

17:01.510 --> 17:03.360
you'll have to surrender
your military command.

17:03.440 --> 17:04.960
You were born to be a great general.

17:05.400 --> 17:07.750
The lives of tens of thousands
in northwest depend on you.

17:07.808 --> 17:09.520
You can't let your talent go to waste.

17:12.400 --> 17:14.310
I only want you to live well

17:14.680 --> 17:16.310
and be happy every day.

17:23.550 --> 17:25.960
You've had a long, exhausting journey.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.200
Get some rest first.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.656
I'll go to the kitchen

17:28.656 --> 17:30.270
and make a few of your favorite dishes.

17:33.200 --> 17:33.750
Xihe.

17:35.750 --> 17:36.640
You've changed.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.640
You're not as timid as you used to be.

17:38.830 --> 17:40.030
There's a spark in your eyes now

17:40.160 --> 17:42.030
that I never saw back in northwest.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.000
Could it really be because
of the Crown Prince?

17:46.920 --> 17:48.680
Of course. It's because I'm in love.

17:52.980 --> 17:55.500
(East Palace)

17:59.750 --> 18:00.680
Your Highness.

18:08.720 --> 18:09.632
Please take a seat.

18:38.310 --> 18:40.000
I grew this tea myself.

18:40.384 --> 18:42.464
I hope it's to your liking,
Young Master Shen.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.590
A man should set his
sights on greater things,

19:02.608 --> 19:05.070
yet you have time to grow tea.

19:05.270 --> 19:06.680
I'm a straightforward man,

19:06.920 --> 19:08.480
so forgive me for asking,

19:09.590 --> 19:11.640
but do you have consumption?

19:13.000 --> 19:14.000
Seriously?

19:14.128 --> 19:16.160
I only suffer from coughing
and shortness of breath.

19:16.790 --> 19:17.880
If I had consumption,

19:18.000 --> 19:18.880
do you think

19:18.928 --> 19:20.912
they'd still let me
remain in the palace?

19:23.350 --> 19:24.720
Though some time ago,

19:25.790 --> 19:27.070
I did develop an eye condition.

19:27.480 --> 19:29.550
Thankfully, Commandery Princess
went to great lengths

19:29.880 --> 19:30.920
to find treatment for me.

19:30.920 --> 19:32.590
So you're not only frail,

19:32.624 --> 19:34.464
but you had trouble with your eyes, too?

19:34.528 --> 19:35.696
Don't worry, Young Master Shen.

19:36.480 --> 19:38.110
Her Highness found a physician for me,

19:38.110 --> 19:38.976
and I've recovered.

19:39.790 --> 19:40.750
Here in the palace,

19:40.830 --> 19:41.880
everyone else avoids me.

19:42.270 --> 19:43.200
Only Her Highness

19:43.264 --> 19:44.624
is willing to stay close to me.

19:45.920 --> 19:47.500
She worried I'd be
sensitive to the cold,

19:47.792 --> 19:49.440
so she blended an incense
to keep me warm.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.110
She worried I had no appetite,

19:51.480 --> 19:52.480
so she made me wontons.

19:52.816 --> 19:54.432
She even comes to
the East Palace often

19:54.680 --> 19:55.480
to visit me.

19:57.830 --> 19:58.880
Why aren't you eating?

19:59.350 --> 20:00.640
Do you think my pastries

20:00.960 --> 20:01.680
aren't any good?

20:11.440 --> 20:12.750
Youyou has always been like this.

20:12.800 --> 20:14.640
She can never turn her
back on someone in need.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.110
So Her Highness's childhood name

20:23.510 --> 20:24.350
is Youyou.

20:28.816 --> 20:30.270
We must be destined for each other.

20:30.680 --> 20:31.510
My childhood name

20:31.960 --> 20:32.750
is Luming.

20:34.590 --> 20:35.830
How did I never know

20:36.680 --> 20:38.440
His Highness had a childhood name?

20:38.448 --> 20:40.240
As for whether you're
destined for each other,

20:40.320 --> 20:42.270
it's far too soon to say, Your Highness.

20:42.270 --> 20:43.720
I believe persistence will be rewarded.

20:43.960 --> 20:44.880
I'm in love with Youyou.

20:45.240 --> 20:45.880
Your Highness,

20:46.590 --> 20:48.550
you should call my sister Zhaoning.

20:48.750 --> 20:51.590
Otherwise, your declaration of
love may seem rather frivolous.

20:53.350 --> 20:55.110
I've never been in love before.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.720
All I know is

20:58.110 --> 20:59.350
the moment I wake up,

21:00.110 --> 21:01.400
I want to see her right away.

21:02.310 --> 21:03.480
Even in my sleep,

21:04.160 --> 21:05.160
I dream of her.

21:05.808 --> 21:07.648
Whenever I see something wonderful,

21:08.160 --> 21:09.510
I want to give it to her at once.

21:12.640 --> 21:14.030
It's only been a month or two.

21:14.128 --> 21:15.728
You couldn't have loved her so deeply.

21:15.872 --> 21:17.472
Love begins before you even realize it,

21:18.016 --> 21:19.480
and then grows deeper and deeper.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.110
By the time I noticed,

21:21.790 --> 21:23.000
it had taken root in my heart.

21:25.830 --> 21:28.070
And what if my sister
has no feelings for you?

21:28.440 --> 21:29.680
I'd swear on my life

21:29.920 --> 21:30.880
to protect her forever.

21:31.968 --> 21:33.440
You'll have no regret or resentment

21:33.510 --> 21:34.768
even if your love is unrequited?

21:36.400 --> 21:38.070
It would only mean I hadn't done enough.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.350
Even then, I'd have no regrets.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.240
Darn it.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.110
How could I have

21:46.110 --> 21:47.590
let Xihe's childhood name slip?

21:47.856 --> 21:49.350
Now he's using it to get close to her.

21:49.720 --> 21:52.030
He's glib, shamelessly cheesy.

21:52.480 --> 21:54.592
The more I look at him,
the less trustworthy he seems.

21:55.680 --> 21:57.000
My innocent little sister

21:57.000 --> 21:58.680
must've been fooled
by that handsome face.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.440
No. I can't allow this.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.640
(Prince Ding's Manor)
Hurry up.

22:24.640 --> 22:25.160
All right.

22:25.160 --> 22:25.550
Go ahead.

22:27.920 --> 22:28.510
Let me do it.

22:29.070 --> 22:29.640
You?

22:33.830 --> 22:34.510
Watch me.

22:34.790 --> 22:36.110
That's beautifully written.

22:36.960 --> 22:37.480
Bull's-eye!

22:38.030 --> 22:38.940
- Good!
- Good!

22:43.240 --> 22:45.160
Is this how things are
always done in the capital?

22:45.350 --> 22:47.200
The chrysanthemums have merely bloomed,

22:47.270 --> 22:48.928
yet they're holding
such a lavish banquet

22:49.030 --> 22:50.224
and inviting so many guests.

22:50.352 --> 22:52.440
Prince Ding's chrysanthemum
garden is quite famous.

22:52.510 --> 22:54.270
They hold a viewing banquet every year.

23:00.160 --> 23:02.000
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

23:07.110 --> 23:09.030
Your Highness, you're here
for the banquet, too?

23:09.664 --> 23:12.070
Staying cooped up in the palace
all day is terribly dull.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.110
Changtai invited me,

23:13.168 --> 23:14.704
so I came out for a change of scenery.

23:15.590 --> 23:18.030
This entrance is
reserved for the ladies.

23:18.110 --> 23:19.504
The male guests enter over there.

23:19.510 --> 23:20.510
Your Highness,

23:20.510 --> 23:21.440
let's go in together.

23:21.440 --> 23:22.400
With my health...

23:23.240 --> 23:25.160
I've never really fit
in with the other men.

23:25.550 --> 23:28.350
I've always preferred
spending time with the ladies.

23:28.784 --> 23:30.432
You go ahead, Young Master Shen.

23:30.510 --> 23:31.790
I'll go in with Her Highness.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.030
Unless...

23:35.440 --> 23:37.830
you'd rather go in with the ladies, too?

23:37.830 --> 23:39.424
Then the three of us can go together.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.110
No need.

23:48.400 --> 23:50.200
After you, Your Highness.

23:51.830 --> 23:53.510
Please wait,
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

23:58.750 --> 23:59.790
(Gu Qingshu?)

24:01.640 --> 24:03.310
Greetings, Your Highness.

24:03.310 --> 24:04.832
Greetings, Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

24:04.840 --> 24:05.720
County Princess Liyang,

24:05.760 --> 24:06.680
how may we help you?

24:06.830 --> 24:08.070
Your Highness,

24:08.350 --> 24:09.640
my brother-in-law told me

24:09.888 --> 24:11.296
that before my sister passed away,

24:11.300 --> 24:13.808
she and Her Highness were
close friends who exchanged letters.

24:13.824 --> 24:15.160
My sister was quiet by nature

24:15.160 --> 24:16.624
and rarely socialized with anyone.

24:16.656 --> 24:17.920
I'm truly grateful to you

24:18.200 --> 24:19.550
for being such a dear friend to her.

24:20.030 --> 24:21.160
She's gone now.

24:21.216 --> 24:23.392
There's no need to thank me,
County Princess Liyang.

24:25.590 --> 24:26.270
Your Highness,

24:26.400 --> 24:28.400
it gets very windy in the capital
this time of year.

24:28.830 --> 24:30.550
I happen to have a hand warmer with me.

24:31.110 --> 24:32.440
Please take it,

24:32.440 --> 24:33.270
if you don't mind...

24:41.240 --> 24:42.640
I've overstepped.

24:43.240 --> 24:44.480
Zhaoning,

24:44.590 --> 24:46.680
of course His Highness
would take good care of you.

24:52.240 --> 24:53.310
Let's go in together.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.390
His Highness is rather
particular about cleanliness.

25:04.400 --> 25:06.880
He's not used to Her Highness
using other people's things.

25:06.976 --> 25:09.030
Please don't take offense,
County Princess Liyang.

25:15.030 --> 25:16.440
The Gu family's second daughter

25:16.496 --> 25:18.048
isn't someone to be underestimated.

25:19.880 --> 25:20.750
Look at this one.

25:21.590 --> 25:22.680
It's beautiful.

25:23.110 --> 25:24.350
This one's such a lovely color.

25:24.464 --> 25:25.510
And it smells wonderful.

25:32.256 --> 25:33.960
There are all sorts
of people here today.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.720
Be sure to watch everyone carefully.

25:36.256 --> 25:38.030
Thank you for the warning,
Your Highness.

25:38.310 --> 25:39.350
Let's go look over there.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.000
All right.

25:40.510 --> 25:41.400
Take a look.

25:46.510 --> 25:47.200
Xihe.

25:48.030 --> 25:49.400
That's Prince Ding's Consort,

25:49.510 --> 25:50.310
Li Yanhui.

25:54.016 --> 25:55.790
Please take your seat
first, Your Highness.

25:55.880 --> 25:56.920
I'll be right back.

25:57.168 --> 25:58.000
I'll wait for you.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.200
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:09.550 --> 26:10.680
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:10.750 --> 26:12.000
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:14.000 --> 26:15.200
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.830
A grown man,

26:17.160 --> 26:18.790
openly mingling with the ladies,

26:19.590 --> 26:20.880
grinning from ear to ear.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.000
Has he no sense of propriety?

26:24.920 --> 26:25.830
Young Master Shen.

26:27.680 --> 26:28.640
Prince Lie.

26:37.310 --> 26:37.830
Young Master.

26:37.830 --> 26:39.030
I'm a straightforward man,

26:39.200 --> 26:40.070
so I'll speak plainly.

26:40.576 --> 26:42.450
When it came to choosing a husband
for my sister,

26:42.480 --> 26:43.830
Father and I originally favored you.

26:44.830 --> 26:46.550
But after what happened
with the defense map,

26:46.790 --> 26:48.750
Father became
somewhat displeased with you.

26:49.110 --> 26:50.480
I acted rashly

26:50.550 --> 26:51.590
and offended Her Highness.

26:52.270 --> 26:54.590
I let both the Duke of Wei and you down.

26:54.736 --> 26:56.310
You needn't dwell on it, Your Highness.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.720
At court,

26:57.720 --> 26:59.640
you risked your life for our family.

26:59.776 --> 27:01.750
How could I not know
your feelings are sincere?

27:02.110 --> 27:04.030
You're brave and
accomplished, Prince Lie.

27:04.680 --> 27:06.880
You're far more impressive

27:07.030 --> 27:08.110
than that sickly weakling.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.750
I still think

27:10.110 --> 27:11.240
you and my sister

27:11.240 --> 27:12.110
are the best match.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.350
I haven't won Her Highness's heart.

27:16.864 --> 27:18.960
That only means I haven't
done nearly enough.

27:19.744 --> 27:20.960
Don't worry, Your Highness.

27:21.310 --> 27:22.830
As long as Xihe agrees,

27:22.830 --> 27:24.224
Father will never stand in your way.

27:24.440 --> 27:25.720
If you still wish to marry her,

27:25.720 --> 27:26.160
I...

27:26.270 --> 27:28.030
Her Highness is the only lady I love.

27:29.200 --> 27:30.200
My resolve to marry her

27:30.960 --> 27:32.000
is unshakable.

27:34.310 --> 27:34.750
Good.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.200
Let's have another drink.

27:36.550 --> 27:37.030
All right.

27:38.720 --> 27:39.750
Try this one.

27:39.750 --> 27:40.440
It's quite good.

27:40.550 --> 27:41.750
Come on, have another drink.

27:42.270 --> 27:43.200
It really is good.

27:44.550 --> 27:46.110
Greetings, Princess Ding.

27:46.820 --> 27:49.820
(Li Yanhui, Princess Ding)

27:49.830 --> 27:51.700
There's no need to stand
on ceremony with me.

27:51.728 --> 27:53.344
I'm not one
of your empire's noble ladies.

27:53.440 --> 27:55.510
I've no patience for all
your rules and etiquette.

27:58.750 --> 28:00.680
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is of noble birth.

28:02.160 --> 28:04.240
His Majesty is personally
choosing a husband for her.

28:04.550 --> 28:06.680
What other lady could
receive such an honor?

28:07.200 --> 28:08.110
Princess Ding,

28:08.240 --> 28:10.310
why are you treating her this way?

28:17.696 --> 28:20.070
You've only just gone from
death-row prisoner to titled lady,

28:20.400 --> 28:22.590
and already you're rushing
to curry favor with everyone?

28:23.400 --> 28:24.790
The Gu family produced a daughter

28:24.790 --> 28:26.224
as proud and unyielding as Gu Qingzhi.

28:26.304 --> 28:28.580
How did they end up raising a
spineless sycophant like you?

28:29.376 --> 28:31.440
You disrespected
Commandery Princess Zhaoning first,

28:31.584 --> 28:33.200
and now you're mocking me in public.

28:33.830 --> 28:34.640
Li Yanhui,

28:34.912 --> 28:36.880
you don't
still think you're a princess, do you?

28:37.550 --> 28:38.880
Nanzhou has fallen.

28:39.104 --> 28:41.024
If it weren't
for His Majesty's arranged marriage,

28:41.030 --> 28:42.992
and Prince Ding agreed
to take you as his wife,

28:43.040 --> 28:44.704
do you think you would have survived?

28:54.000 --> 28:54.790
I told you,

28:54.790 --> 28:55.590
be careful.

28:56.830 --> 28:57.960
Prince Lie,

28:58.240 --> 29:00.440
did you see how Crown Prince
moved just now?

29:00.750 --> 29:03.070
Wasn't he supposed
to have no martial arts skills?

29:03.790 --> 29:05.160
What's going on?

29:16.310 --> 29:17.070
Make way.

29:23.940 --> 29:26.140
(Xiao Changtai, Fourth Prince,
Prince Ding)

29:26.160 --> 29:27.310
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:30.432 --> 29:32.528
I'm sorry you were
frightened just now, Your Highness.

29:32.576 --> 29:34.224
I failed to look after
my guests properly.

29:34.400 --> 29:35.550
Please forgive me.

29:44.960 --> 29:45.550
Yanyan.

29:47.152 --> 29:48.200
County Princess Liyang

29:48.400 --> 29:50.240
is the lady Father
intends for Changqing.

29:52.750 --> 29:54.550
Your family's affairs
are none of my concern.

29:55.960 --> 29:57.310
She started this,

29:57.590 --> 29:59.110
so I've no reason to let her off.

29:59.680 --> 30:00.440
If I don't

30:01.030 --> 30:02.750
carve a mark across her face today

30:02.750 --> 30:04.070
and let her taste the consequences,

30:04.080 --> 30:05.570
she'll dare to
do worse in the future!

30:05.580 --> 30:07.030
I'm a lady personally
ennobled by His Majesty!

30:07.030 --> 30:07.750
So what?

30:07.750 --> 30:08.480
Enough.

30:08.480 --> 30:09.030
Yanyan,

30:09.400 --> 30:10.400
calm down.

30:12.720 --> 30:13.750
You're trying to stop me?

30:19.680 --> 30:21.160
It's only a face.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.640
Is it really that important?

30:33.070 --> 30:34.110
It's just one cut.

30:34.560 --> 30:35.550
It won't kill anyone.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.110
Yanyan!

30:57.440 --> 30:58.160
Your Highness,

30:58.920 --> 30:59.960
why are you doing this?

31:00.510 --> 31:03.240
You used me
to provoke Princess Ding

31:03.440 --> 31:04.590
and cause trouble.

31:04.790 --> 31:06.550
If I had been cut
by these porcelain shards,

31:06.830 --> 31:08.350
would that have been what you wanted?

31:09.000 --> 31:10.200
It was only an accident.

31:12.110 --> 31:13.640
I may be of low status,

31:14.030 --> 31:15.110
but I won't let you

31:15.510 --> 31:16.510
humiliate me like this.

31:16.510 --> 31:17.350
Humiliate you?

31:18.160 --> 31:19.400
I merely told the truth.

31:19.400 --> 31:20.688
And you call that humiliation?

31:21.200 --> 31:22.160
It seems you don't know

31:22.160 --> 31:23.640
what true humiliation feels like.

31:24.790 --> 31:25.440
Mo Yu.

31:42.550 --> 31:43.550
Your Highness,

31:43.960 --> 31:45.550
you're the highest-ranking person here.

31:45.680 --> 31:47.480
You saw everything that happened today.

31:48.480 --> 31:50.030
Please judge this matter

31:50.830 --> 31:52.070
and clear my name.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.920
Commandery Princess Zhaoning is

31:59.510 --> 32:00.720
gentle and sweet by nature.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.240
After what happened today,

32:04.080 --> 32:05.550
she must've been terribly frightened.

32:05.830 --> 32:07.400
You're all well-bred young ladies,

32:07.400 --> 32:09.000
so please look out for her.

32:09.400 --> 32:11.750
Don't let anyone with ill intentions
get near her

32:12.070 --> 32:13.070
and frighten her again.

32:17.648 --> 32:19.550
They have your favorite
peach blossom drink.

32:19.550 --> 32:21.110
Let's go have some to calm your nerves.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.310
Your Highness,

32:27.680 --> 32:29.640
my sister's usually not like this.

32:30.720 --> 32:32.720
Whenever she's with Huayong,

32:33.640 --> 32:35.350
she's always so free-spirited.

32:36.384 --> 32:37.990
So this is what you
people in the capital

32:38.110 --> 32:39.480
call free-spirited?

33:01.720 --> 33:02.790
Your Highness.

33:12.976 --> 33:13.880
How are you feeling?

33:14.590 --> 33:15.400
Any better?

33:16.160 --> 33:17.000
Brother-in-law,

33:17.160 --> 33:18.030
I don't even know

33:18.030 --> 33:19.888
how I offended
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

33:21.790 --> 33:23.400
She was utterly ruthless.

33:23.552 --> 33:25.830
With the Crown Prince taking her side,
she fears nothing.

33:26.688 --> 33:29.088
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is as broad-minded as any man.

33:29.750 --> 33:31.790
She'd never hold a grudge
over something trivial.

33:33.510 --> 33:34.750
What exactly did you do?

33:36.720 --> 33:37.590
Brother-in-law,

33:38.480 --> 33:39.830
I'm your sister-in-law,

33:39.830 --> 33:41.510
yet you're taking Shen Xihe's side?

33:43.110 --> 33:44.400
After what she did to me,

33:44.496 --> 33:45.960
aren't you going to stand up for me?

33:46.350 --> 33:47.110
From now on,

33:48.550 --> 33:50.480
stay away from
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

33:51.720 --> 33:52.510
Saving you

33:53.110 --> 33:54.350
was the last thing I could do

33:55.070 --> 33:56.920
for your sister and the Gu family.

33:57.248 --> 33:58.480
If you think that gives you

33:58.640 --> 34:00.480
the freedom to do as you please,

34:01.952 --> 34:03.510
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.710
Your Majesty, please bestow
upon him his courtesy name.

35:30.280 --> 35:31.880
Now that the rites are complete,

35:32.280 --> 35:33.800
on this auspicious day,

35:34.150 --> 35:35.760
I hereby bestow upon you

35:36.110 --> 35:38.710
the courtesy name Beichen.

35:39.920 --> 35:41.480
Thank you, Your Majesty.

35:50.960 --> 35:53.440
"To govern by virtue
is like the North Star,

35:53.472 --> 35:56.320
steadfast in its place while all
the other stars revolve around it."

35:56.880 --> 35:59.400
His Majesty has clearly decided

35:59.480 --> 36:01.030
to pass the throne to the Crown Prince.

36:05.230 --> 36:06.230
Rise.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.840
Trying to pledge your allegiance now

36:23.070 --> 36:24.630
is a little premature.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.280
Huayong,

36:27.840 --> 36:29.190
the ceremony is over.

36:29.760 --> 36:33.070
You should return to
the East Palace and get some rest.

36:33.120 --> 36:35.030
I still need to pay my respects
to our brothers.

36:35.510 --> 36:37.440
I appreciate the thought,

36:37.800 --> 36:38.630
but...

36:38.920 --> 36:40.190
given your health,

36:40.400 --> 36:42.070
you may skip

36:42.320 --> 36:43.320
these formalities.

36:43.800 --> 36:44.880
Minister of Rites.

36:45.216 --> 36:47.408
Now that the coming-of-age ceremony
is complete,

36:47.710 --> 36:50.070
tomorrow, all the civil
and military officials,

36:50.280 --> 36:52.920
along with the imperial
princes and royal kinsmen,

36:53.150 --> 36:56.550
shall gather at Qinzheng Hall

36:56.550 --> 36:59.030
to perform the fourfold ceremonial
bow before the Crown Prince.

37:09.150 --> 37:09.670
Xihe,

37:10.190 --> 37:11.320
I'm going to see Grandfather.

37:21.400 --> 37:22.800
Ladies weren't supposed to attend

37:23.840 --> 37:25.360
Crown Prince's
coming-of-age ceremony.

37:27.960 --> 37:29.320
His Majesty gave his permission.

37:32.840 --> 37:34.800
By attending his coming-of-age ceremony,

37:35.392 --> 37:37.616
you've made your relationship
known to everyone.

37:38.592 --> 37:40.070
You're leaving yourself no way out?

37:41.230 --> 37:43.070
Do you really think

37:43.312 --> 37:45.712
I'm the kind of woman who
changes her affections on a whim?

37:49.880 --> 37:51.590
My feelings for the Crown Prince

37:51.960 --> 37:53.000
will never change.

37:54.144 --> 37:56.608
He could barely make it through
his coming-of-age ceremony.

37:57.030 --> 37:57.800
His health...

37:57.800 --> 37:59.000
I know exactly

37:59.010 --> 38:00.790
what kind of condition
the Crown Prince is in.

38:30.070 --> 38:31.030
You have to let her go.

38:32.880 --> 38:34.230
No matter how hard it is.

38:38.000 --> 38:39.230
You want me to let go,

38:40.000 --> 38:42.030
yet you yourself are obsessed with her.

38:48.800 --> 38:50.480
I can't stand by and watch her

38:50.630 --> 38:51.800
marry someone else.

38:55.030 --> 38:55.880
Including you.

38:58.656 --> 39:00.400
I won't try to talk
you out of it anymore,

39:00.752 --> 39:02.704
and you don't need to
talk me out of it either.

39:03.800 --> 39:05.360
Even if we are brothers,

39:07.110 --> 39:08.880
I won't give up the lady I love.

39:20.510 --> 39:22.000
The Crown Prince isn't just frail.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.360
He's smooth-talking, too.

39:23.360 --> 39:24.670
He's hardly an ideal husband.

39:25.000 --> 39:26.150
I can't stop worrying.

39:26.480 --> 39:28.400
Will you please think it over again?

39:29.000 --> 39:30.550
The men in northwest are too rough,

39:31.190 --> 39:33.110
and the men in the capital
are all smooth talkers.

39:33.232 --> 39:35.000
According to you, none
of them is any good.

39:36.150 --> 39:37.030
Fine then.

39:37.030 --> 39:38.550
Just take me back to northwest.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.280
I'll never marry anyone.

39:40.880 --> 39:43.320
You've never spoken
to me like this before.

39:43.670 --> 39:44.590
See?

39:44.688 --> 39:46.208
You're taking Crown Prince's side.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.800
How has Father been these days?

39:57.400 --> 39:58.880
Ever since you left,

39:59.030 --> 40:00.070
he's carried around

40:00.070 --> 40:02.280
the jade ring you used
to play with as a child.

40:02.336 --> 40:05.424
When he heard His Majesty and Empress
Dowager were choosing a husband for you,

40:05.440 --> 40:06.480
he started preparing.

40:06.590 --> 40:09.070
He brought out the grape
wine he'd been aging for twelve years.

40:09.136 --> 40:09.880
As for your dowry,

40:10.110 --> 40:12.030
he prepared 300 cartloads.

40:12.190 --> 40:14.590
He also reclaimed
100 qing of military farmland

40:14.920 --> 40:16.280
along the Shule River.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.440
He said

40:18.230 --> 40:19.800
that when you finally marry,

40:19.936 --> 40:22.000
the sound of the golden
wheat swaying in the wind

40:22.070 --> 40:23.630
would be the finest wedding music

40:23.630 --> 40:25.070
a father could offer his daughter.

40:25.510 --> 40:26.550
He also said

40:26.960 --> 40:28.190
that guarding northwest

40:28.360 --> 40:29.510
is our duty,

40:30.550 --> 40:32.190
the greatest dowry we can give you,

40:32.670 --> 40:34.190
and your strongest protection

40:34.480 --> 40:36.550
and greatest support here in the palace.

40:39.150 --> 40:40.150
There's no one else

40:40.400 --> 40:41.550
in this world

40:42.840 --> 40:45.030
who loves his daughter
as much as Father does.

40:48.670 --> 40:49.550
Xihe,

40:50.190 --> 40:52.880
all we've ever wanted is
for you to live a carefree life

40:53.150 --> 40:55.030
and find someone to grow old with.

40:56.710 --> 40:57.880
But Crown Prince...

40:58.070 --> 40:59.030
I know.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.190
Yun'an,

41:01.920 --> 41:03.110
I'm all grown up now.

41:03.590 --> 41:05.150
I know how to make my own choices

41:05.320 --> 41:06.320
and what I need to do.

41:10.320 --> 41:11.000
Xihe,

41:11.760 --> 41:13.190
you really have changed.

41:14.384 --> 41:15.880
It's because heaven has blessed me,

41:15.920 --> 41:17.504
and because I have a father and brother

41:17.630 --> 41:18.840
who love me so much,

41:18.840 --> 41:20.510
that's why I can walk
the path I choose.

41:21.550 --> 41:22.920
So please don't worry about me.

41:23.480 --> 41:24.710
Whatever I choose for myself,

41:25.150 --> 41:26.590
no matter what happens in the future,

41:27.000 --> 41:28.110
I will have no regrets.

41:35.150 --> 41:35.710
By the way,

41:36.280 --> 41:36.920
Yun'an,

41:37.360 --> 41:39.400
I'm going to Fahua Temple
tomorrow to pray.

41:40.070 --> 41:40.840
I'll go with you.

41:41.190 --> 41:42.840
I've made plans with Young Master Bu.

41:42.840 --> 41:43.710
Don't worry.

41:44.630 --> 41:45.880
That playboy?

41:46.280 --> 41:47.840
You've gotten awfully close to him.

41:48.190 --> 41:50.150
Don't tell me he's
another one of your suitors.

41:53.550 --> 41:54.440
He's my best friend.

42:18.510 --> 42:21.550
(I, Shen Xihe, pray for
peace in northwest.)

42:21.550 --> 42:23.840
(May the people be safe,
and my family protected.)

42:25.440 --> 42:26.400
(And after marriage,)

42:26.464 --> 42:28.720
(may I walk hand in hand
with the Crown Prince,)

42:29.088 --> 42:31.216
(and may we live our
remaining years without regret.)

42:46.630 --> 42:47.230
Your Highness!

42:47.480 --> 42:48.280
Xihe!

42:48.630 --> 42:49.400
I'm fine.

42:51.150 --> 42:51.880
Your Highness,

42:51.960 --> 42:53.110
the wheel has broken.

42:53.230 --> 42:54.630
It'll take some time to repair it.

43:25.190 --> 43:25.920
Your Highness!

43:44.880 --> 43:46.030
An Embroidered Envoy?

43:49.872 --> 43:52.190
So you're the coward who shot
that arrow from the shadows.

43:53.150 --> 43:53.710
Talk.

43:54.590 --> 43:55.880
Who sent you?

44:11.230 --> 44:13.880
Looks like I went too
easy on you last time.

44:14.016 --> 44:15.856
You clearly haven't learned your lesson.

44:15.872 --> 44:16.780
(Qing)
These are among

44:16.816 --> 44:18.670
the few remaining paintings
my wife left behind.

44:18.670 --> 44:20.000
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

44:20.000 --> 44:21.070
All burned.

44:21.110 --> 44:24.110
I did it so that you
wouldn't cling to any lingering hopes.

44:24.150 --> 44:26.480
(Qing)
Lest you do something outrageous again.

44:26.800 --> 44:28.190
It's been so long.

44:32.710 --> 44:35.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

44:36.270 --> 44:39.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

44:39.940 --> 44:46.910
♪So never uncover♪

44:47.100 --> 44:49.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:50.590 --> 44:53.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:54.280 --> 44:59.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

45:01.380 --> 45:04.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

45:05.000 --> 45:07.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

45:08.640 --> 45:12.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

45:12.270 --> 45:15.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

45:18.550 --> 45:21.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

45:22.980 --> 45:25.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

45:26.580 --> 45:32.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

45:33.750 --> 45:36.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

45:37.330 --> 45:40.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

45:40.450 --> 45:47.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:47.090 --> 45:50.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:51.630 --> 45:54.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:54.830 --> 45:57.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:58.400 --> 46:04.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

46:05.750 --> 46:09.300
♪You'll never♪

46:09.580 --> 46:19.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:45.220 --> 46:48.700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
